---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Acerca de — Cactus Byte Studio" 
  title_en="About Me — Cactus Byte Studio"
  description="Conocé la historia detrás de Cactus Byte Studio, un estudio unipersonal de videojuegos y chiptune."
  description_en="Discover the story behind Cactus Byte Studio, a solo developer and chiptune musician."
>
  <h1 class="section-title">
    <span class="lang-es">Acerca de mí</span>
    <span class="lang-en">About Me</span>
  </h1>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="pixel-box about-main-box">
      <div class="avatar-wrapper">
        <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Cactus Byte Studio Avatar" class="about-avatar" />
      </div>
      <div class="bio-text">
        <h2>
          <span class="lang-es">Detrás del Cactus</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Behind the Cactus</span>
        </h2>
        
        <p class="lang-es">
          ¡Hola! Soy el desarrollador, diseñador y músico unipersonal detrás de <strong>Cactus Byte Studio</strong>. 
          Este proyecto nació de mi fascinación por la tecnología retro y los límites impuestos por el hardware clásico, 
          los cuales obligaban a los creadores a resolver problemas con pura creatividad.
        </p>
        <p class="lang-en">
          Hello! I am the solo developer, designer, and musician behind <strong>Cactus Byte Studio</strong>. 
          This project was born out of my fascination with retro technology and the constraints imposed by classic hardware, 
          which forced creators to solve problems with pure creativity.
        </p>
        
        <p class="lang-es">
          Desde chico me interesó cómo funcionaban los videojuegos, lo que me llevó a estudiar programación y 
          experimentar con motores como Godot y Unity. Paralelamente, mi amor por la música me llevó al mundo del 
          <strong>Chiptune</strong>, componiendo temas musicales directamente en consolas portátiles clásicas.
        </p>
        <p class="lang-en">
          Since I was a kid, I have been interested in how video games work, which led me to study programming and 
          experiment with engines like Godot and Unity. Meanwhile, my love for music drew me to the world of 
          <strong>Chiptune</strong>, composing music directly on classic handheld consoles.
        </p>
        
        <p class="lang-es">
          Creo firmemente que el software artesanal, el pixel art y los videojuegos de alcance reducido pero pulidos 
          tienen una magia especial que a veces se pierde en las grandes producciones.
        </p>
        <p class="lang-en">
          I firmly believe that handcrafted software, pixel art, and small-scope yet polished games carry a 
          special magic that sometimes gets lost in large-scale productions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sidebar-boxes">
      <div class="pixel-box interests-box">
        <h3>
          <span class="lang-es">Intereses</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Interests</span>
        </h3>
        <ul class="interests-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Retro-Engineering:</strong>
            <span class="lang-es">Creación de juegos para hardware antiguo (Game Boy, NES, PICO-8).</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Game development for vintage hardware (Game Boy, NES, PICO-8).</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Música Limitada:</strong>
            <span class="lang-es">Composición con rastreadores (trackers) de sonido como LSDj y DefleMask.</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Composition using sound trackers like LSDj and DefleMask.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Diseño Geométrico:</strong>
            <span class="lang-es">Pixel art enfocado en líneas duras, simetría y paletas de color reducidas.</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Pixel art focused on hard lines, symmetry, and restricted color palettes.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Godot Engine:</strong>
            <span class="lang-es">Mi motor principal para el desarrollo de juegos independientes modernos.</span>
            <span class="lang-en">My primary engine for modern indie game development.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="pixel-box setup-box">
        <h3>
          <span class="lang-es">El Laboratorio</span>
          <span class="lang-en">The Lab</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="setup-desc">
          <span class="lang-es">Herramientas que uso a diario:</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Tools I use daily:</span>
        </p>
        <div class="tools-grid">
          <span class="badge">Godot 4</span>
          <span class="badge">Aseprite</span>
          <span class="badge">LSDj</span>
          <span class="badge">VS Code</span>
          <span class="badge">Famitracker</span>
          <span class="badge">Astro</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-main-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 2.5rem;
  }

  .avatar-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--color-border);
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-avatar {
    width: 140px;
    height: 140px;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
    filter: drop-shadow(4px 4px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.4));
  }

  .bio-text h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--color-accent-yellow);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .bio-text p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .bio-text p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .sidebar-boxes {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .interests-box h3,
  .setup-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-accent-yellow);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .interests-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .interests-list li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .interests-list li::before {
    content: "▪";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: -1px;
    color: var(--color-accent-green);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .interests-list li strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .setup-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tools-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    
    .about-main-box {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
